# Prototype build output. Only what proofport-app downloads for its App Attest
# development switch is committed: the circuit json, its .srs and the marker
# naming the noir-rs that wrote it, the vk, and the SHA256SUMS the app checks
# downloads against. Witnesses, proofs and the Solidity verifier stay local.
target/*
!target/coinbase_app_attest_poc.json
!target/coinbase_app_attest_poc.srs
!target/coinbase_app_attest_poc.srs.toolchain
!target/SHA256SUMS
!target/vk/
target/vk/*
!target/vk/vk
!target/vk/vk_hash
!target/vk/SHA256SUMS
